{
  "slug": "k12mcp",
  "name": "K12mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Description: K-12 compliance and integration guidance for developers. Covers FERPA, COPPA, state privacy laws, DPA readiness, SIS, rostering, and procurement.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `coppa` (Analyze COPPA applicability for products where children under 13 may be users), `dpa` (Check DPA (Data Processing Agreement) readiness for a K-12 edtech product), `ferpa` (Check FERPA compliance for K-12 data fields or workflows), `procurement` (Get K-12 procurement pathway guidance for edtech vendors), `rostering` (Get rostering protocol recommendations for K-12 edtech products), `scan-codebase` (Scan field names, route names, or data model identifiers for potential K-12 PII exposure), `sis-info` (Get integration details for K-12 Student Information Systems (SIS)), `state-privacy` (Look up state student privacy laws for one or more U.S)\n- **Agents** (1): `compliance-review` (Runs a full K-12 compliance review for a product in development)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `k12mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install k12mcp@claude-community` from `crafty184/k12mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
